<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr" data-theme="dark">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Marketing Digital & Growth | Hozana Concept</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Growth marketing, gestion réseaux sociaux, publicités Facebook/Google/TikTok, SEO. Hozana Concept multiplie votre visibilité et vos ventes à l'échelle mondiale. Audit gratuit.">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="images/favicon-logo.png">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Sora:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Roboto:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,700;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@fortawesome/fontawesome-free@6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/design-system.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/components.css">
  <style>
    .svc-page-hero{
      padding: calc(var(--nav-height) + 6rem) 2rem 6rem;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-align: center;
      min-height: calc(var(--nav-height) + 480px);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
    }
    @media(max-width:1024px){.svc-page-hero{padding: calc(var(--nav-height) + 5rem) 1.5rem 5rem; min-height: calc(var(--nav-height) + 400px);}}
    @media(max-width:768px){.svc-page-hero{padding: calc(var(--nav-height) + 4rem) 1.25rem 4rem; min-height: auto;}}
    @media(max-width:480px){.svc-page-hero{padding: calc(var(--nav-height) + 3rem) 1rem 3rem;}}
    .svc-page-hero::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse 90% 70% at 50% -5%,rgba(255,46,46,0.2) 0%,transparent 55%),radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 45% at 95% 55%,rgba(255,106,0,0.12) 0%,transparent 50%),radial-gradient(ellipse 45% 35% at 5% 70%,rgba(255,46,46,0.07) 0%,transparent 55%);}
    .svc-page-hero::after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:60px 60px;}
    .svc-hero-glow{position:absolute;width:700px;height:700px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(255,46,46,0.09) 0%,transparent 70%);top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-55%);pointer-events:none;z-index:0;}
    .svc-page-hero .container{position:relative;z-index:1;width:100%;}
    .svc-page-cat{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem;padding:0.35rem 1rem;border-radius:999px;font-family:var(--font-accent);font-size:0.72rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;background:rgba(255,46,46,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(255,46,46,0.25);color:#FF7070;margin-bottom:1.5rem;}
    .svc-cards-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:1.5rem;margin-top:3rem;}
    .svc-card-item{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:20px;padding:2rem;transition:border-color .25s,transform .25s,background .25s;position:relative;overflow:hidden;}
    .svc-card-item:hover{border-color:rgba(255,46,46,0.3);background:rgba(255,46,46,0.04);transform:translateY(-4px);}
    .svc-card-item::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:2px;background:var(--grad-red);opacity:0;transition:opacity .25s;}
    .svc-card-item:hover::before{opacity:1;}
    .svc-item-icon{width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:14px;background:rgba(255,46,46,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(255,46,46,0.2);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--red);margin-bottom:1.25rem;}
    .svc-item-title{font-family:var(--font-title);font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--white);margin-bottom:0.75rem;}
    .svc-item-desc{font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--white-60);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:1.25rem;}
    .svc-item-feats{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.45rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;}
    .svc-item-feats li{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.6rem;font-size:0.82rem;color:var(--white-70);}
    .svc-item-feats li i{font-size:0.6rem;color:var(--red);margin-top:0.35em;flex-shrink:0;}
    .svc-item-cta{font-family:var(--font-accent);font-size:0.82rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--red);text-decoration:none;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0.4rem;transition:gap .2s;}
    .svc-item-cta:hover{gap:0.65rem;}
    .results-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:1rem;margin-top:2.5rem;}
    .result-metric{padding:1.5rem 1rem;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);border-radius:16px;text-align:center;}
    .result-metric-val{font-family:var(--font-title);font-size:2rem;font-weight:900;background:var(--grad-red);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;line-height:1;margin-bottom:0.5rem;}
    .result-metric-lbl{font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--white-50);font-family:var(--font-accent);}
    .process-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:1.25rem;margin-top:3rem;}
    .process-step{text-align:center;padding:2rem 1.5rem;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);border-radius:16px;}
    .process-step-num{font-family:var(--font-title);font-size:3rem;font-weight:900;background:var(--grad-red);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;line-height:1;margin-bottom:0.75rem;}
    .process-step-title{font-family:var(--font-accent);font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--white-90);margin-bottom:0.5rem;}
    .process-step-desc{font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--white-50);line-height:1.6;}
    .svc-page-cta{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,46,46,0.09),rgba(255,106,0,0.06));border:1px solid rgba(255,46,46,0.15);border-radius:24px;padding:5rem 3rem;text-align:center;}
    .svc-page-cta::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.025) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.025) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:40px 40px;pointer-events:none;}
    .svc-page-cta::after{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:50%;height:1px;background:var(--grad-red);opacity:.7;}
    .svc-page-cta>*{position:relative;z-index:1;}
    @media(max-width:768px){.svc-cards-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.svc-page-cta{padding:3rem 1.5rem;}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="loader"><img src="images/favicon-logo.png" alt="Hozana" style="width:60px;height:60px;object-fit:contain;margin-bottom:0.5rem;"><div class="loader-bar"><div class="loader-bar-fill"></div></div></div>
<div id="navbar-placeholder"></div>

<section class="svc-page-hero">
  <div class="svc-hero-glow"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="svc-page-cat reveal"><i class="fas fa-chart-line"></i> Marketing Digital</div>
    <h1 class="text-display reveal delay-1" style="max-width:800px;margin:0 auto 1.5rem;font-size:clamp(2.2rem,5vw,3.8rem);line-height:1.1;">
      Croissance digitale<br><span class="gradient-text">à grande échelle</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="text-body-lg reveal delay-2" style="max-width:580px;margin:0 auto 2.5rem;color:var(--white-60);font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.75;">
      Stratégies data-driven, publicités ciblées, SEO et social media — nous activons tous vos leviers de croissance pour attirer plus de clients et <strong style="color:var(--white-80);">maximiser votre ROI.</strong>
    </p>
    <div class="reveal delay-3" style="display:flex;gap:1rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:3.5rem;">
      <a href="contact" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg"><i class="fas fa-rocket"></i> Booster ma croissance</a>
      <a href="pricing" class="btn btn-glass btn-lg">Voir les packs <i class="fas fa-arrow-right" style="font-size:0.8em;"></i></a>
    </div>
    <div class="results-row reveal delay-3" style="max-width:750px;margin:0 auto;">
      <div class="result-metric"><div class="result-metric-val">+247%</div><div class="result-metric-lbl">Trafic organique</div></div>
      <div class="result-metric"><div class="result-metric-val">×4.2</div><div class="result-metric-lbl">ROI publicités</div></div>
      <div class="result-metric"><div class="result-metric-val">−67%</div><div class="result-metric-lbl">Coût / acquisition</div></div>
      <div class="result-metric"><div class="result-metric-val">12k</div><div class="result-metric-lbl">Abonnés en 4 mois</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="background:var(--black-2);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="text-center mb-lg reveal"><div class="section-label">4 leviers de croissance</div><h2 class="text-h2">Ce que nous <span class="gradient-text">activons pour vous</span></h2></div>
    <div class="svc-cards-grid">
      <div class="svc-card-item reveal">
        <div class="svc-item-icon"><i class="fas fa-seedling"></i></div>
        <div class="svc-item-title">Growth Marketing</div>
        <div class="svc-item-desc">Stratégies data-driven pour accélérer votre croissance. A/B testing, optimisation des funnels et expérimentation continue pour maximiser chaque euro investi.</div>
        <ul class="svc-item-feats">
          <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Stratégie de croissance sur mesure</li>
          <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> A/B testing & expérimentation</li>
          <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Optimisation des funnels</li>
          <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Attribution multi-touch</li>
          <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Growth hacking avancé</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="contact" class="svc-item-cta">Accélérer ma croissance <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
      </div>
      <div class="svc-card-item reveal delay-1">
        <div class="svc-item-icon"><i class="fas fa-share-nodes"></i></div>
        <div class="svc-item-title">Social Media Management</div>
        <div class="svc-item-desc">Gestion complète de vos réseaux sociaux. Création de contenu, planification, engagement et reporting pour construire une communauté engagée.</div>
        <ul class="svc-item-feats">
          <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Stratégie éditoriale & calendrier</li>
          <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Création de posts & stories</li>
          <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Instagram, Facebook, LinkedIn, TikTok</li>
          <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Community management</li>
          <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Reporting mensuel performance</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="contact" class="svc-item-cta">Gérer mes réseaux <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
      </div>
      <div class="svc-card-item reveal delay-2">
        <div class="svc-item-icon"><i class="fas fa-bullseye"></i></div>
        <div class="svc-item-title">Publicités (Facebook, Google, TikTok)</div>
        <div class="svc-item-desc">Campagnes publicitaires qui convertissent. Ciblage précis, visuels percutants et optimisation constante pour un ROI maximal.</div>
        <ul class="svc-item-feats">
          <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Meta Ads (Facebook & Instagram)</li>
          <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Google Ads & YouTube Ads</li>
          <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> TikTok Ads & Snapchat</li>
          <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Retargeting & lookalike audiences</li>
          <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Optimisation ROAS en continu</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="contact" class="svc-item-cta">Lancer mes campagnes <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
      </div>
      <div class="svc-card-item reveal delay-1">
        <div class="svc-item-icon"><i class="fas fa-magnifying-glass"></i></div>
        <div class="svc-item-title">SEO (Référencement Google)</div>
        <div class="svc-item-desc">Positionnez-vous en tête des résultats Google. SEO technique, content strategy et link building pour un trafic organique durable et rentable.</div>
        <ul class="svc-item-feats">
          <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Audit SEO technique complet</li>
          <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Recherche de mots-clés & stratégie</li>
          <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Optimisation on-page & contenu</li>
          <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Link building & netlinking</li>
          <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> SEO local & Google Business</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="contact" class="svc-item-cta">Améliorer mon SEO <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="text-center mb-lg reveal"><div class="section-label">Notre méthode</div><h2 class="text-h2">Résultats <span class="gradient-text">dès le premier mois</span></h2></div>
    <div class="process-steps">
      <div class="process-step reveal"><div class="process-step-num">01</div><div class="process-step-title">Audit & Analyse</div><div class="process-step-desc">Analyse de votre présence actuelle, concurrents et opportunités.</div></div>
      <div class="process-step reveal delay-1"><div class="process-step-num">02</div><div class="process-step-title">Stratégie</div><div class="process-step-desc">Plan d'action priorisé avec objectifs mesurables et KPIs définis.</div></div>
      <div class="process-step reveal delay-2"><div class="process-step-num">03</div><div class="process-step-title">Exécution</div><div class="process-step-desc">Déploiement des campagnes, création de contenu et optimisation.</div></div>
      <div class="process-step reveal delay-3"><div class="process-step-num">04</div><div class="process-step-title">Reporting</div><div class="process-step-desc">Dashboard en temps réel + rapport mensuel détaillé et recommandations.</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="background:var(--black-2);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="svc-page-cta reveal">
      <div class="section-label" style="justify-content:center;">Prêt à croître ?</div>
      <h2 class="text-h1" style="margin:0.75rem 0 1.5rem;">Activons vos <span class="gradient-text">leviers de croissance</span></h2>
      <p class="text-body-lg" style="max-width:500px;margin:0 auto 2rem;">Audit marketing gratuit. On analyse votre présence digitale et on vous propose un plan d'action concret avec des résultats attendus.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:1rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <a href="contact" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg"><i class="fas fa-chart-line"></i> Audit marketing gratuit</a>
        <a href="pricing" class="btn btn-glass btn-lg">Voir les packs</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div id="footer-placeholder"></div>
<script src="js/core.js"></script>
<script src="js/components.js"></script>
</body>
</html>

